<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/5/eng@/~part_III> <https://schema.org/text> "TRANSITIONAL PROVISIONS General provisions"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/5/eng@> .
