<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/5/eng@/~part_II__cl_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The principal Act is amended by substituting for section 21 the following section: 21. (1) Except as provided in this section, the basis year for a year of assessment shall constitute, in relation to a source of a person, the basis period for that year of assessment."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/5/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/5/eng@/~part_II__cl_3__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/5/eng@/~part_II__cl_3> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/5/eng@> .
