<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/5/eng@/~part_I__cl_1__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Sections 2, 3, 5 and 6 of this Act comes into force on 1 January 2000 and sections 20, 21, 77 and 92 as amended by those sections shall have effect for the year of assessment 2000 in respect of the basis period ending in the year 1999."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/5/eng@> .
